  "title": "Wine-Soaked Mushrooms",
  "description": "These sautéed mushrooms and onions with wine make a great side dish to beef recipes or topping for steaks and crostini. Red wine and beef broth are reduced until almost no liquid is left.",
  "authors": [
    "HARRY WETZEL"
